OL,3,GNEWSASailing cancelled amid lowest
OL,4,Awater level since 1997
OL,5,
OL,6,FA sailing club that teaches people with
OL,7,Fdisabilities to learn to sail said it
OL,8,Fmight have to curb its season early due
OL,9,Fto low water levels.
OL,11,FThe Wolverstone Project Sailing Club,
OL,12,Fwhich operates on Alton Water, Suffolk,
OL,13,Fnormally sails on the reservoir until
OL,14,FDecember.
OL,16,FHowever, due to low water levels, the
OL,17,Fpontoon, used for sailors to board
OL,18,Fboats, has been left high and dry and
OL,19,Factivities temporarily stopped.
OL,23,APub: 05-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,380,370,200,160,0,100
