OL,3,GNEWSASailing cancelled amid lowest
OL,4,Awater level since 1997
OL,5,
OL,6,FSally Moore, a trustee at the charity,
OL,7,Fsaid volunteers would try and move the
OL,8,Fpontoon deeper into the water and if
OL,9,Fthat failed "unfortunately that will be
OL,10,Fthe end of our sailing season."
